{"seq":42,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1428"},"reason":"The London Eye is no longer Europe's tallest Ferris wheel: the 140-metre Sun of Moscow (VDNKh) overtook its 135 m in September 2022, though the London Eye's 120 m wheel is still larger in diameter. The body now says it held the European record for more than two decades until 2022, adds the Sun of Moscow to the text and table, adds notes explaining this, and marks Ain Dubai's world title as 'as of 2026' (it reopened on 26 December 2024 and is still the tallest).","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sun_of_Moscow"},{"url":"https://en.moscow-sun.ru/"},{"url":"https://www.londoneye.com/about-us/history/"},{"url":"https://www.aindubai.com/en"},{"url":"https://www.thenationalnews.com/lifestyle/things-to-do/2024/12/26/ain-dubai-reopens-tickets/"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",120],["+","For more than two decades "],["=",6],["-","is"],["+","was"],["=",238],["+"," Its European height record lasted until September 2022, when the 140-metre Sun of Moscow opened in the VDNKh park; the London Eye's 120-metre wheel is still the larger in diameter."],["=",373],["-","2021"],["+","2021,"],["=",1],["+","and still as of 2026, "],["=",235],["+","\n| Sun of Moscow | Moscow | 140 m | 2022 |"],["=",66]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",106],["-","Europas"],["+","Mehr"],["=",1],["-","Rekordhalter"],["+","als"],["=",1],["-","ist"],["+","zwei"],["=",1],["+","Jahrzehnte lang war "],["=",4],["-","Eye."],["+","Eye"],["=",1],["+","Europas Rekordhalter. "],["=",213],["+"," Seinen europäischen Höhenrekord hielt es bis September 2022, als im Park WDNCh die 140 Meter hohe Sonne Moskaus eröffnet wurde; das Rad des London Eye ist mit 120 Metern Durchmesser aber weiterhin das größere."],["=",349],["+","– Stand 2026 – "],["=",229],["+","\n| Sonne Moskaus | Moskau | 140 m | 2022 |"],["=",70]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",102],["-","Европейский"],["+","Более"],["=",1],["-","рекордсмен"],["+","двух"],["=",1],["-","—"],["+","десятилетий"],["=",1],["+","европейским рекордсменом был "],["=",205],["+"," Европейский рекорд высоты продержался до сентября 2022 года, когда в парке ВДНХ открылось 140-метровое «Солнце Москвы»; по диаметру колеса (120 метров) Лондонский глаз по-прежнему больше."],["=",327],["+","(по состоянию на 2026 год) "],["=",225],["+","\n| Солнце Москвы | Москва | 140 м | 2022 |"],["=",70]]},{"field":"notesEn","old":"","new":"Since September 2022 the Sun of Moscow (140 m) has been Europe's tallest Ferris wheel; the London Eye (135 m, 120 m diameter) held the European record from 2000 to 2022."},{"field":"notesDe","old":"","new":"Seit September 2022 ist die Sonne Moskaus (140 m) das höchste Riesenrad Europas; das London Eye (135 m, 120 m Durchmesser) hielt den europäischen Rekord von 2000 bis 2022."},{"field":"notesRu","old":"","new":"С сентября 2022 года самое высокое колесо обозрения Европы — «Солнце Москвы» (140 м); Лондонский глаз (135 м, диаметр 120 м) удерживал европейский рекорд с 2000 по 2022 год."}],"hash":"ad484f3c1405","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"2a2557570b1e20baf8fa570c5c45b09ec9bdd70ef4e727917252b946f856fcca"},
