{"seq":44,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"reworded","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w07136"},"reason":"The card asked which 135 m wheel 'is the tallest in Europe'. That has been outdated since the 140 m Sun of Moscow opened in 2022. The question now asks which wheel, opened in 2000, was Europe's tallest until 2022. The card's own words stay in cardText.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sun_of_Moscow"},{"url":"https://en.moscow-sun.ru/"}],"changes":[{"field":"en","old":"Which Ferris wheel, 135 metres high, is the tallest in Europe?","new":"Which Ferris wheel, 135 metres high and opened in 2000, was the tallest in Europe until 2022?"},{"field":"de","old":"Welches Riesenrad ist mit 135 Metern Höhe das höchste Fahrgeschäft Europas?","new":"Welches 135 Meter hohe, im Jahr 2000 eröffnete Riesenrad war bis 2022 das höchste Europas?"},{"field":"ru","old":"Какое колесо обозрения высотой 135 метров — самое высокое в Европе?","new":"Какое колесо обозрения высотой 135 метров, открытое в 2000 году, было самым высоким в Европе до 2022 года?"},{"field":"cardText","new":"Welches Riesenrad ist mit 135 Metern Höhe das höchste Fahrgeschäft Europas?"}],"hash":"9a286ab1d4c9","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"0a01a8637655b4c49deb65fe03128d674e0c0a558cd9bc198aebe9f71b048bfc"},
